            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.7547/0003-0538-104.5.550</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The absence of the hallucal tibial sesamoid is seldom seen in the clinical setting. We present a case of a symptomatic missing tibial sesamoid in a female marathon runner.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
